# The FX views and the note's edges: kept on every page, Stage too, so a note begun or ended there still
# lights the delay's echo and starts the reverb's marker from when it ended; the moving pages redraw each
# 32 ms step whatever the note's start (nothing stale at any step); the Modulation stops with the note,
# not with the reverb's tail. (Run from boot: no note has been seen before the first.)
wait 200
# Reverb 2, its Mix up; a note begun on Stage, back on Reverb 2 while it plays: moving, nothing stale
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
expect view 20
breath 0 120 20
tap PLAY
expect stage 1
midi 90 45 64
wait 200
tap PLAY
expect stage 0
expect view 20
wait 16
expect stale 0
expect blits >-1
wait 500
expect blits >12
wait 16
expect stale 0
wait 16
expect stale 0
wait 16
expect stale 0
wait 16
expect stale 0
midi 80 45 00
wait 300
# notes begun 32 ms apart, each step after nothing stale
midi 90 45 64
wait 16
expect stale 0
wait 16
expect stale 0
wait 16
expect stale 0
wait 16
expect stale 0
wait 16
expect stale 0
wait 16
expect stale 0
midi 80 45 00
wait 300
wait 32
midi 90 45 64
wait 16
expect stale 0
wait 16
expect stale 0
wait 16
expect stale 0
wait 16
expect stale 0
wait 16
expect stale 0
wait 16
expect stale 0
expect blits >-1
wait 500
expect blits >12
midi 80 45 00
wait 300
# the Delay (Mix 50): a note begun on Stage lights the first echo (350 ms) on the Delay page
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
expect view 18
spin K2 50
wait 100
tap PLAY
midi 90 45 64
wait 200
tap PLAY
expect view 18
wait 140
expect col64_95 6
midi 80 45 00
wait 2000
# the Reverb (Mix 30): a note ended on Stage, the marker from when it ended (about 600 ms: x 86, not the start)
tap FX
expect view 19
spin K2 27
midi 90 45 64
wait 300
tap PLAY
midi 80 45 00
wait 450
tap PLAY
expect view 19
wait 50
expect col86_100 6
expect col19_100 -1
# the Modulation (Mix 30) with a 60 s reverb behind it: still once the note ends
spin K3 50
wait 5000
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
expect view 17
spin K2 30
midi 90 45 64
wait 300
midi 80 45 00
wait 100
expect level >0
expect blits >-1
wait 2000
expect blits <3
expect stale 0
